WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.530
Hi, Anna!

2
00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:04.390
Hi, Bruna! Thanks for telling me about this event.

3
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:09.050
Sure! It's much better than staring at your computer. I hope it helps with your story.

4
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:13.070
I’m sure it will. So, what should we see first?

5
00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:17.850
Dance and music are very important to Peruvian culture, so let’s watch the dancers.

6
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.150
Great! Let’s go!

7
00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:57.930
There's this very special Peruvian dance called Marinera Norteña.

8
00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:00.410
I love the Marinera Norteña… !

9
00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:00.410
Marinera Norteña.

10
00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:00.410
Marinera Norten… ?

11
00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.610
No. Marinera Norteña.

12
00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:13.030
I love the … marriage dance!

13
00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:22.710
Bruna, I read about this dance. But it is much more romantic in person!

14
00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:27.330
The dancers are giving lessons after their performance. You should try it!

15
00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:31.870
I’d love to. But I’m not ready to get married.

16
00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:36.110
I mean, one day I hope to meet the right guy.

17
00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:42.930
We’ll buy matching motorcycles and ride into the sunset -- the wind blowing through our hair!

18
00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:49.110
Anna, the dance just shows the courtship tradition. It doesn’t mean you will get married.

19
00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.390
Oh. Well, I’ll try anyway.

20
00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:02.730
Don’t forget. This festival also shows Peruvian art!

21
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.630
I hope I have time to see everything!

22
00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:09.010
Anna, I wish I could join you. But I have some work to do.

23
00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:13.290
Of course, of course. You go back to work. I’ll check out the art.

24
00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:17.830
Okay, I’m hoping to finish in about an hour. Let’s meet then.

25
00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:18.870
Great. See you then!
